  "name": "stronk",
  "description": "A Rust-based digital signal processing toolkit focused on the design and implementation of FIR and IIR filter architectures. It provides specialized support for Butterworth filter approximations, Karplus-Strong string synthesis, and bilinear transforms for mapping Laplace-space poles to the Z-domain. The system includes utilities for frequency response analysis and real-time audio streaming via the CPAL host interface.",
